Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.10,0:00:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across the sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.62,0:00:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Raising our voices we take!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,In the beautiful blue world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.94,0:00:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.84,0:00:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go get the sails all unfurled!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.68,0:00:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we are in between\Nthe sea and the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.42,0:00:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready now for adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We're itching to try!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.92,0:00:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready to roam!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So all aboard now we're set to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.94,0:00:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Set sail to the ocean so deep!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.08,0:00:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready for a truly grand adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.30,0:00:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well don't you think\Nthat sounds really fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All this excitement is second to none!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.20,0:00:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Raising our voices we take!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.06,0:00:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,In the beautiful blue world!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.18,0:00:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.92,0:01:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go get the sales all unfurled!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.92,0:01:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's something that\NI just won't ever forget!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.74,0:01:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the way that I felt\Nwhen our journey was set!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.28,0:01:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I won't be scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.86,0:01:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I keep that feeling there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.26,0:01:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,With that, let us keep up the pace!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.46,0:01:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,While enjoying every\Ntrip from place to place!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.04,0:01:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Our timid hearts get the rhythm ingrained!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.12,0:01:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's keep going, adventure awaits!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.60,0:01:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So many treasures await!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.88,0:01:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So now let's raise our voices in pride!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.40,0:01:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Laughing out when they are found!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.70,0:01:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the riches in\Nhand, everybody rejoices!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.30,0:01:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Party on, cause we stand tall and proud!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.72,0:01:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Life is adventurous, be\Naware it's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.04,0:01:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's gonna be one of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And a trip goes on because.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.44,0:01:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the pirates of the mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:01:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,To the west, to the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.96,0:02:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta find my way, sail away,\Nall the way to one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.78,0:02:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring all your dreams with\Nyou, now fill the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.26,0:02:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In your heart, spread your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And believe that you can soar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let the breeze guide the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Till you're ready to start up once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're ready for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.70,0:02:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So many treasures away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So now let's raise our voices in pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.14,0:02:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Laughing out when they are found.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.44,0:02:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the riches in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices, party on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.82,0:02:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we stand tall and proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.42,0:02:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, you're flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.12,0:02:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.48,0:02:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're awful brave all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.28,0:02:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I had you running scared a minute ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.60,0:02:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did all this confidence come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.66,0:02:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I just got a little nervous\Nback there and I panicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.62,0:02:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I never dreamt that there\Ncould be a person so
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.90,0:03:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,inherently negative that\Nthey'd be immune to my ghosts?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.86,0:03:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's only one thing I\Nhave to say to such a person!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.66,0:03:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheer up, life is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.26,0:03:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.02,0:03:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You really think that you're safe for me\Njust because you can fly, little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.50,0:03:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're dealing with a sniper, flying or\Ndancing, and it makes no difference to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.18,0:03:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.74,0:03:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my new weapon, Kabuto.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.90,0:03:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It features five pivots for\Nenhanced stability and reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.14,0:03:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And the breath dial I got from Sky Island
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.44,0:03:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Activates the precise\Nmoment that I take my shot,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.44,0:03:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Allowing me to spin the ammo\Nin any direction I desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.28,0:03:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,so there's no escaping\Nthis super slingshot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.74,0:03:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Flame, flash, impact!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.90,0:03:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got every dial I need, and each one\Nmakes my shot stronger than the last!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.08,0:03:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're as good as gone once\NI've got you in my sights!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.68,0:03:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now prepare yourself for...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.48,0:03:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait! She's gone already? What the\Nhell? What happened? Where did she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.00,0:03:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.28,0:04:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, try to hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.14,0:04:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I've made it easy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.34,0:04:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell kind of monster are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.38,0:04:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.78,0:04:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes Butterfly Meteor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.52,0:04:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.43,0:04:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,She's back to her normal size?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.42,0:04:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you? Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.86,0:04:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Try and fly away from this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.36,0:04:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mantis Meteora.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.24,0:04:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Your hands. You stabbed\Nthem right through my chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.82,0:04:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They're inside me. It hurts\Nso much I can't even feel it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.30,0:05:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna bleed to death! Stop! Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.92,0:05:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.83,0:05:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dead man!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.75,0:05:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.00,0:05:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot, look a little closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.42,0:05:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,My hands are inside you, but\Nyour skin's not even punctured.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.88,0:05:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren't hurt at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.38,0:05:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me reassure you that you\Nare still on the verge of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.06,0:05:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.62,0:05:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm mere inches away from wrapping\Nmy fingers around your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.14,0:05:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And squeezing it until it pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.58,0:05:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.34,0:05:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't make my heart pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.24,0:05:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.22,0:05:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But you are going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.12,0:05:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.38,0:05:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Writhe in beautiful agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.70,0:05:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.92,0:05:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.12,0:05:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.90,0:05:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No I don't want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.78,0:05:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah I can't actually do any of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.96,0:06:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You weren't bluffing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.48,0:06:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You made me hurt my hand.\NCome on. Just. Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.44,0:06:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If I could actually crush\Nyour heart like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.32,0:06:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd have been dead the moment I\Nstuck my hands inside your chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.12,0:06:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still gotta be bad for my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.88,0:06:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My hands didn't even\Nreally touch your chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.22,0:06:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They just passed right through.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.86,0:06:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.52,0:06:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,my body might
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.43,0:06:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,look just as solid as yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.82,0:06:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I can pass through anything\Nyou can think of. As if.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.86,0:06:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,There was nothing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.14,0:06:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Special attack Viper Star 6!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.12,0:06:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You weren't listening to me, were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.82,0:06:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, oh, this is just gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.32,0:06:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can pass through anything, what\Nmakes you think your attacks will hit me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.86,0:07:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.77,0:07:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.69,0:07:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away, damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.70,0:07:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone, you're freaking me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.06,0:07:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your plan now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.60,0:07:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't harm me with any\Nof your feeble attacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.26,0:07:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.34,0:07:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If you were only bluffing earlier\Nwhen you threatened to crush my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.74,0:07:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And you were then that means as big\Nas you talk, you can't even touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.20,0:07:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I might not be able to attack you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.72,0:07:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But, you can't attack me either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.80,0:07:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.34,0:07:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mihawk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.48,0:07:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do with those?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.26,0:07:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And Ghostwrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.04,0:07:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.24,0:07:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off me, go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.52,0:08:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ghostwrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.40,0:08:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I still attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.78,0:08:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Firebird star!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.38,0:08:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.60,0:08:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.98,0:08:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,None of my attacks can touch her, but she\Ncan hurt me with the snap of her fingers!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.32,0:08:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sticking around for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.76,0:08:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.06,0:08:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see with you there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.70,0:08:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.72,0:08:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.92,0:08:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And ghost rap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.36,0:08:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just one embarrassment after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.94,0:08:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.44,0:09:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I get for\Nthinking I had the upper hand
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The bear?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.74,0:09:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.40,0:09:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumasi is much stronger than\Nthe average bear, you know
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.08,0:09:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.16,0:09:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No one in our crew stands a chance against\Nthis girl So why did I think I would?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.66,0:09:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And why'd I have to go bragging\Nthat only I can take her down?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.72,0:09:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how strong you are, you\Ndon't stand a chance against her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.50,0:09:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,All you can do is run.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.90,0:09:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry, I'll\Ntake care of her for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.74,0:09:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought this was my moment to shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.36,0:09:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And then of course, this happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.68,0:09:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.30,0:09:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I just can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.58,0:09:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.26,0:09:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a gunner for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.00,0:09:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And then that girl's gonna\Ncapture everyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.74,0:10:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And completely wipe out our crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.68,0:10:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I could save them for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.26,0:10:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I need saving.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.46,0:10:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.24,0:10:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.60,0:10:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sniper King.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.04,0:10:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Sniper King,\Nwhat would you do here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.10,0:10:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumasi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.24,0:10:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.15,0:10:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you harm my sweet Kumasi?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.54,0:10:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And what the hell's with\Nthat stupid mask you got on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.68,0:10:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're looking at the face of your doom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.52,0:10:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.18,0:10:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the one and only Sniper King.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.98,0:11:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the exact same guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.62,0:11:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just wearing a dumb mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.50,0:11:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.41,0:11:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just gonna run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.46,0:11:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.42,0:11:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to fight Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.30,0:11:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.28,0:11:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I've given all I've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.70,0:11:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I can win against her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.98,0:11:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.16,0:11:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're the kind\Nof man who can win this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.62,0:11:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What history are you basing that on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.06,0:11:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,None of that is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.84,0:11:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,motivation regardless think
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.48,0:11:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,carefully don't you find\Nher behavior a little odd?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.86,0:11:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah that's been bugging me especially\Nhow she got so confident all of a sudden
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.34,0:11:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,she was completely terrified of me and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.56,0:11:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,running for her life back there if she
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.98,0:11:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,was impervious to my attacks all along\Nthere was no point in running for me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.48,0:11:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,like that she could have just flown away\Nor walk right through one of the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.08,0:11:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But she didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.40,0:11:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All she did was run away\Nscreaming at the top of her lungs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.58,0:12:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What was she freaking out\Nabout if I couldn't hit her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.22,0:12:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.98,0:12:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ruff! Ruff!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.86,0:12:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.42,0:12:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything about her changed\Nthe moment I lost sight of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.32,0:12:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So the question is, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.84,0:12:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I Got wrapped up in dealing\Nwith that stupid zombie bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.46,0:12:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's when it happened right\Nwhen I lost sight of her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.86,0:12:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I better hand you\Nover to Moria now. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.20,0:12:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.32,0:12:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Look carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.26,0:12:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be someplace\Nto hide around here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.62,0:12:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a trap door or hidden room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.08,0:12:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.12,0:12:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on to your tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.08,0:12:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.99,0:12:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Are those your last words?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.86,0:12:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.16,0:13:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're aiming at?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.60,0:13:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.30,0:13:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No, hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.38,0:13:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Special attack Atlas Comet!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.06,0:13:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.32,0:13:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.40,0:13:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I found your real body, ghost girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.40,0:13:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see you playing a stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.00,0:13:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But you can fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.92,0:13:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You can walk straight\Nthrough walls and people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.24,0:13:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And to top it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.24,0:13:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You can change your size at will.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.78,0:13:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no paranormal expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.84,0:13:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But it sure sounds like\Nyou're a ghost to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.94,0:13:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So the question is: why would a\Nghost run away from me? Like you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.48,0:14:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.92,0:14:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing that makes sense is\Nthat you had a physical body when.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.46,0:14:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I was chasing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.38,0:14:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.46,0:14:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,My point is: you're a ghost duplicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.88,0:14:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You slipped out of your\Nbody and became a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.20,0:14:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as I lost sight of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.54,0:14:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.46,0:14:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your real body.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.88,0:14:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done falling for your tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.86,0:14:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And here I thought you were\Njust some pessimistic idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.88,0:14:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Did your little superhero\Nmass make you feel better?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.02,0:14:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Still.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.93,0:14:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you had the\Nwits to figure it all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.58,0:14:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're only about 90. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.56,0:14:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not just a ghost duplicate\Nbeing controlled by my real body.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.76,0:14:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My entire spirit is able\Nto detach and float free.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.64,0:14:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A hollow with its own will,\Nleaving my body empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.10,0:14:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for explaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.46,0:14:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.88,0:14:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think would happen if\Nyou didn't have a body to go back to?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.90,0:14:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I've got a feeling that my attacks
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.84,0:15:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,are actually going to\Nhit this time around.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.00,0:15:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.32,0:15:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.58,0:15:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll blow you to bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.86,0:15:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes my big bang star.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.48,0:15:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That was way too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.80,0:15:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But you missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.98,0:15:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And it looks like it was a dud anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.28,0:15:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This one won't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.82,0:15:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I'm giving you another shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.12,0:15:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Special hollow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.90,0:15:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That one isn't going to\Nblow up, is it? Mini hollow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.44,0:15:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A giant version of the ones from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.14,0:15:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.04,0:15:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Get this thing off me, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.04,0:15:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You just stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.20,0:15:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not letting you lay\Na finger on my real body.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.06,0:15:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on, wait,\Ncan't we talk about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.76,0:15:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Those little ones are turning up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.00,0:15:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you just use those on me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.88,0:15:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This big one will blow me to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.76,0:15:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You can struggle all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.40,0:15:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.50,0:15:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're inside a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.66,0:16:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.68,0:16:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.59,0:16:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me out of this damn thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.04,0:16:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad you mucked up\Nthat shot, Long Nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.04,0:16:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,With a simple snap of my fingers, you'll\Nbe reduced to a puddle of guts and goo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.28,0:16:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Please don't! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.62,0:16:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't stay that way for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.74,0:16:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hogback will use whatever's left\Nof you to make a Long Nose zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.62,0:16:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Kamikaze, wrap!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.12,0:16:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No! It vanished!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.36,0:16:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That was too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.94,0:16:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I used this impact dial\Nto absorb the explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.58,0:16:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.30,0:16:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.21,0:16:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.42,0:16:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a bluff. What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.32,0:16:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, that shot I took at you earlier\Nlanded exactly where I wanted it to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.60,0:16:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And it wasn't a dud either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.38,0:16:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It was actually a sticky star bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.64,0:17:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I made sure you couldn't move after\Nyou returned to your real body.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.22,0:17:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You did what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.62,0:17:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that your ghost and body are one...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.40,0:17:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can kill two birds with one shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.46,0:17:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.48,0:17:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who purified\Nour Captain Kumasi, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.50,0:17:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What perfect timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.12,0:17:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now take the creep out,\NLieutenant Hippo gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.82,0:17:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.94,0:17:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.02,0:17:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, is he actually strong after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.70,0:17:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So much pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.16,0:17:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like my arm's going to snap it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.86,0:17:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Hippo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.90,0:17:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Special attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.06,0:17:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiny Black Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.68,0:18:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Cockroaches!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.72,0:18:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Also known as the Roach Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.58,0:18:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.88,0:18:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Get them off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.54,0:18:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.54,0:18:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.44,0:18:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,They're getting in my clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.66,0:18:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I hate cockroaches!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.24,0:18:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, somebody kill Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.56,0:18:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling cockroaches\Nwould freak you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.86,0:18:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you want to know what\Nyou really should be scared of?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.68,0:18:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're looking at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.90,0:18:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't have\Nunderestimated me, princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.44,0:18:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I was known through the\Nentire stretch of East Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.30,0:18:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,As the strongest man who ever lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.90,0:18:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten tons?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.28,0:18:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you even fit that much\Nstrength in that scrawny body of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.90,0:19:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even have a chance, I\Ncan't move Please, please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.08,0:19:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.10,0:19:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll die if you hit me with that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.54,0:19:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And get these disgusting roaches off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.94,0:19:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Not the hammer, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.14,0:19:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Not the cockroaches, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.52,0:19:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.92,0:19:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Please spare my life! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.28,0:19:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.56,0:19:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I won't lay a finger on\Nyour crew if you let me live!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.34,0:19:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.48,0:19:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.39,0:19:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.31,0:19:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.64,0:19:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,GOLDEN POUND!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.00,0:19:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That is one sad ghost princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.52,0:19:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Though she should be\Nashamed of herself passing
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.94,0:20:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,out at the sight of some\Ntoy roaches in a balloon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.40,0:20:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about a stupid move.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.72,0:20:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody challenges Usopp in the art\Nof negativity and lying and wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.04,0:20:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You just stay put until sunrise!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.48,0:20:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.90,0:20:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounded like the\Nsamurai said something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.56,0:20:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.84,0:20:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,A better question.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.68,0:20:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the hell's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.42,0:20:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.62,0:21:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,In short, it looks like the\Nbattle between them's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.50,0:21:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen many fights in my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.50,0:21:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,but I assure you none of them\Nhave been anything like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.02,0:21:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So you think you can take my black\Nblade Chess away from me, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.62,0:21:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm taking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.18,0:21:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to cut you down and\Nwrench it from your cold, dead body.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.16,0:21:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.66,0:21:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling cocky today, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.58,0:21:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.06,0:21:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a good idea to provoke him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.70,0:21:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks to me that you already\Nhave three swords. True.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.64,0:21:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But one's broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.28,0:21:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And I've gotten used to carrying\Nthree, so it feels weird not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.36,0:21:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.27,0:21:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I use three-sword style.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.06,0:21:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Three-sword style, huh? Never heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.72,0:22:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it some sort of circus act?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.78,0:22:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's nothing like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.92,0:22:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I assure you, it's too\Nbad. I wish I could show.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.14,0:22:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,you but I'll just beat\Nyou with two swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.46,0:22:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.40,0:22:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I can sense you're very skilled
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.14,0:22:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling that I've long forgotten\Nis welling up inside me once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.82,0:22:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as if I'm facing some sort\Nof a beast, a savage animal!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.64,0:22:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The strange sensation echoing deep in my
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.86,0:22:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,bones makes me feel as\Nif I'm dancing on air.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.86,0:22:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.62,0:22:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No bother to drive!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.40,0:22:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.08,0:22:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,it's a thrust, one of my techniques,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.16,0:23:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,but when I use it, it doesn't\Ndo nearly as much damage.
